[00:12.16] Keep goin' getting higher
[00:14.87] New worlds waiting in the sky
[00:16.76] Escape the feasting and the hunger
[00:18.52] Not the monsters in our minds
[00:29.51] Got our hands on a ship
[00:31.35] And stole away into the night
[00:34.04] The four of us and Pasha dear
[00:35.98] She to steer and we to fight
[01:12.45] Fed up with rules and regulations
[01:14.29] No more laughter left on Earth
[01:16.02] Outer Space our one salvation
[01:18.88] May God help us in our search
[01:29.83] We fled so fast that we grew younger
[01:31.68] Put the ship on cruise control
[01:33.45] We all did our best with Pasha
[01:36.23] But not as good as good ol' Joe
[03:19.37] Monsters, monsters, monsters... In the night
[03:26.67] Monsters, monsters, monsters... In black and white
[03:34.05] Monsters, monsters, monsters... Out of control
[03:42.26] Monsters, monsters, monsters... When you're alone
[03:50.46] Monsters, monsters, monsters... Feed on themselves
[03:58.65] Monsters, monsters, monsters... On the road to hell
[04:16.06] Love never should have entered
[04:17.82] It was never in the plan
[04:20.70] We were finally going to have her
[04:22.43] And let Joe be damned!
[04:29.85] Joe awoke from a stupor
[04:30.74] It was clear something was wrong
[04:33.48] He rushed in and found us with her
